# s19-menu-timeout.drv - S19: the start-position menu times out back to the intro.
#
# Verifies: FI-06 (the timeout half), scenario S19 (short form).
# Method: Space at 6 s opens the menu; then no input at all; a shot every
#         second for 14 s, then one at 20 s. The first shot that shows the
#         intro again brackets the timeout to about 1 s of host time
#         (drive.py records each shot's time in manifest.json). This counts
#         host seconds, not VBLs: S19's VBL count needs an instrumented core.
# Run:  python3 tools/drive/drive.py --script tools/drive/scripts/s19-menu-timeout.drv \
#           --out RUN_DIR --timeout 60
# Expect: exit 0; the first shots show the menu; later shots show the intro.

wait 6000
key space         # the menu opens
wait 1000
shot m01
wait 1000
shot m02
wait 1000
shot m03
wait 1000
shot m04
wait 1000
shot m05
wait 1000
shot m06
wait 1000
shot m07
wait 1000
shot m08
wait 1000
shot m09
wait 1000
shot m10
wait 1000
shot m11
wait 1000
shot m12
wait 1000
shot m13
wait 1000
shot m14
wait 6000
shot m20
quit
